# What must not be copied into the build stage.
#
# The Dockerfile runs `COPY . .` before `npm ci`. Without this, the host's
# node_modules is copied in and then shadows the one the image installs — and
# on a Windows host those are the wrong platform's binaries, so the Linux
# build fails or, worse, succeeds against native modules that cannot run.
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/

# Local environment overrides. Vite inlines every VITE_ variable into the
# bundle it produces, so a stray .env.local would ship its values to every
# visitor. The image gets its values from the build arg instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build noise and things that never affect the output.
.git/
*.log
coverage/
*.md
